# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Science of Science -- what stays out of git
#
# The repository tracks CODE and small reference tables: notebooks, *_common.py
# modules, SLURM job scripts, per-pipeline Readme.txt files, validation figures.
# Bulk data lives on Midway only (/project/jevans/Dawoon/Science of Science).
# Everything under the headings below is rebuildable from the notebooks or is a
# raw-data mirror, and most of it is far above GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Excluded pipeline (kept out of this repository on purpose) ---------------
Atypicality/
jobs/Atypicality/

# --- Bulk data: metric outputs, caches, raw mirrors ---------------------------
*.parquet
*.parquet.*
*.npz
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.gml
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.feather
*.arrow
*.db
*.duckdb
*.sqlite
*.zip
*.tsv
*.tsv.gz
*.csv.gz

# Data directories (rebuildable caches and raw dumps)
**/cache/
**/raw/
PatentView/Granted/
PatentView/Pregranted/

# Large CSV inputs (the tiny schema/reference CSVs are re-included below)
*.csv
!openalex_2026_*.csv
!OpenAlex/Abstract data/*.csv

# --- Small summary tables that ARE committed (all under ~1 MB) ----------------
!**/output/*_feg_disruption_trend.parquet
!**/output/*_disruption_trend_summary.parquet
!**/output/*_disruption_compare.parquet

# --- SLURM logs and run artefacts --------------------------------------------
**/logs/
*.out
*.err
slurm-*.out
.duckdb_tmp/
duckdb_tmp/

# --- Editor / interpreter noise ----------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# --- Manuscript drafts (not code, not data) ------------------------------------
PPP/*.pdf

# --- Ad-hoc backups (superseded versions are kept in <pipeline>/Old/ instead) --
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak.*

# --- Superseded by README.md -------------------------------------------------
Readme.txt
!*/Readme.txt
!*/*/Readme.txt
